      "title": "UI/UX",
      "content": "A product needs both to succeed. If an app has great UX (it is fast and well-organized) but bad UI (unreadable text and clashing colors), users will be deterred. Conversely, if an app has beautiful UI (gorgeous graphics) but bad UX (confusing navigation and slow loading), it will be frustrating to use.",
